{"id":"vd-a2-the-night-the-lights-went-out","level":"a2","n":35,"title":{"en":"Is Anybody There?","vi":"Có ai ở đó không?"},"summary":"Mất điện, bà Weiss bị kẹt trong thang máy; Jamal và ông Sato hàng xóm lần lượt hỏi han, trấn an và đề nghị giúp bà.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-night-the-lights-went-out","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Night the Lights Went Out","vi":"Đêm mất điện"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[]},"cast":{"jamal":{"name":{"en":"Jamal","vi":"Jamal"},"look":"teenboy","x":480,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#8D5A3B","skinShade":"#74472D","outfit":"tee","top":"#3F7FCB","topShade":"#2F66AA"}},"weiss":{"name":{"en":"Mrs. Weiss","vi":"Bà Weiss"},"look":"grandma","x":1200,"style":{"hair":"bun","glasses":true}},"sato":{"name":{"en":"Mr. Sato","vi":"Ông Sato"},"look":"man","x":880,"style":{"hair":"part","hairColor":"#4A4A4A","outfit":"cardigan","top":"#8A7A64","topShade":"#75664F"},"from":8}},"lines":[{"speaker":"weiss","en":"Hello? Can anybody hear me? I'm stuck in here!","vi":"Có ai không? Có ai nghe thấy tôi không? Tôi bị kẹt trong này!","ipa":["həˈloʊ","kæn","ˈɛnibədi","hiɹ","mi","aɪm","stʌk","ɪn","hiɹ"],"start":0.554,"end":5.424,"expression":"worried","visual":{"lights":"off"},"timing":[[0,0.554],[1,2.067],[2,2.308],[3,2.82],[4,3.075],[5,4.34],[6,4.567],[7,4.922],[8,5.05]]},{"speaker":"jamal","en":"Hello! Yes, I'm here. My name's Jamal. Are you OK?","vi":"Bà ơi! Có ạ, cháu ở đây. Cháu tên là Jamal. Bà có sao không ạ?","ipa":["həˈloʊ","jɛs","aɪm","hiɹ","maɪ","neɪmz","dʒəˈmɑl","ɑɹ","ju","oʊˈkeɪ"],"start":6.214,"end":10.654,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,6.214],[1,7.022],[2,7.307],[3,7.47],[4,8.272],[5,8.407],[6,8.856],[7,9.834],[8,9.956],[9,10.16]]},{"speaker":"weiss","en":"I'm Mrs. Weiss, from the eighth floor. It's very dark in here.","vi":"Bà là bà Weiss ở tầng tám. Trong này tối lắm.","ipa":["aɪm","ˈmɪsɪz","waɪs","fɹʌm","ðə","eɪtθ","flɔɹ","ɪts","ˈvɛɹi","dɑɹk","ɪn","hiɹ"],"start":11.444,"end":16.294,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,11.444],[1,11.568],[2,11.994],[3,12.676],[4,12.889],[5,13.003],[6,13.287],[7,14.87],[8,15.126],[9,15.453],[10,15.808],[11,15.922]]},{"speaker":"jamal","en":"Don't worry. I'll call the emergency number now.","vi":"Bà đừng lo. Cháu gọi số khẩn cấp ngay bây giờ.","ipa":["doʊnt","ˈwɝi","aɪl","kɔl","ðə","ɪˈmɝdʒənsi","ˈnʌmbɚ","naʊ"],"start":17.084,"end":20.114,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,17.084],[1,17.3],[2,18.197],[3,18.373],[4,18.686],[5,18.781],[6,19.406],[7,19.719]]},{"speaker":"weiss","en":"Thank you, dear. I'm a bit frightened.","vi":"Cảm ơn cháu. Bà hơi sợ.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","dɪɹ","aɪm","ə","bɪt","ˈfɹaɪtənd"],"start":20.904,"end":24.234,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,20.904],[1,21.112],[2,21.637],[3,23.136],[4,23.334],[5,23.42],[6,23.619]]},{"speaker":"jamal","en":"They're sending an engineer. But it might take two hours.","vi":"Họ đang cử kỹ sư đến. Nhưng có thể mất hai tiếng ạ.","ipa":["ðɛɹ","ˈsɛndɪŋ","æn","ˈɛndʒəˈnɪɹ","bʌt","ɪt","maɪt","teɪk","tu","ˈaʊɚz"],"start":25.024,"end":28.594,"expression":"thinking","thoughtBubble":"clock:9:30","timing":[[0,25.024],[1,25.145],[2,25.648],[3,25.797],[4,27.006],[5,27.129],[6,27.251],[7,27.509],[8,27.781],[9,28.039]]},{"speaker":"weiss","en":"Two hours!","vi":"Hai tiếng á!","ipa":["tu","ˈaʊɚz"],"start":29.384,"end":30.214,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,29.384],[1,29.593]]},{"speaker":"jamal","en":"I'll stay here with you. Do you need anything?","vi":"Cháu sẽ ở đây với bà. Bà có cần gì không ạ?","ipa":["aɪl","steɪ","hiɹ","wɪð","ju","du","ju","nid","ˈɛniˌθɪŋ"],"start":31.004,"end":33.824,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,31.004],[1,31.081],[2,31.434],[3,31.774],[4,31.977],[5,32.725],[6,32.793],[7,32.901],[8,33.214]]},{"speaker":"sato","en":"Is everything all right? I heard voices.","vi":"Mọi chuyện ổn chứ? Tôi nghe thấy tiếng người.","ipa":["ɪz","ˈɛvɹiˌθɪŋ","ɔl","ɹaɪt","aɪ","hɝd","ˈvɔɪsəz"],"start":34.614,"end":37.424,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,34.614],[1,34.744],[2,35.187],[3,35.343],[4,36.416],[5,36.611],[6,36.832]]},{"speaker":"jamal","en":"Mrs. Weiss is stuck in the elevator.","vi":"Bà Weiss bị kẹt trong thang máy ạ.","ipa":["ˈmɪsɪz","waɪs","ɪz","stʌk","ɪn","ðə","ˈɛləˌveɪtɚ"],"start":38.214,"end":40.634,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,38.214],[1,38.519],[2,38.994],[3,39.185],[4,39.646],[5,39.81],[6,39.891]]},{"speaker":"sato","en":"Oh no. I'll get some candles from my apartment.","vi":"Ôi trời. Để tôi lấy ít nến ở nhà.","ipa":["oʊ","noʊ","aɪl","ɡɛt","sʌm","ˈkændəlz","fɹʌm","maɪ","əˈpɑɹtmənt"],"start":41.424,"end":44.564,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,41.424],[1,41.528],[2,42.614],[3,42.809],[4,42.991],[5,43.213],[6,43.642],[7,43.799],[8,43.981]]},{"speaker":"sato","en":"Mrs. Weiss, would you like some hot tea?","vi":"Bà Weiss ơi, bà có muốn uống chút trà nóng không?","ipa":["ˈmɪsɪz","waɪs","wʊd","ju","laɪk","sʌm","hɑt","ti"],"start":45.104,"end":47.334,"expression":"happy","visual":{"lights":"on","fade":2},"timing":[[0,45.104],[1,45.466],[2,46.039],[3,46.221],[4,46.364],[5,46.533],[6,46.755],[7,47.028]]},{"speaker":"weiss","en":"Yes, please! And do you have a blanket? It's cold.","vi":"Có, cảm ơn anh! Anh có chăn không? Lạnh quá.","ipa":["jɛs","pliz","ənd","du","ju","hæv","ə","ˈblæŋkət","ɪts","koʊld"],"start":48.124,"end":53.494,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,48.124],[1,48.759],[2,50.371],[3,50.584],[4,50.684],[5,50.798],[6,50.968],[7,51.067],[8,52.758],[9,53.013]]},{"speaker":"jamal","en":"My sister has one. I'll bring it now.","vi":"Em gái cháu có một cái. Cháu mang ra ngay đây.","ipa":["maɪ","ˈsɪstɚ","hæz","wʌn","aɪl","bɹɪŋ","ɪt","naʊ"],"start":54.284,"end":56.964,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,54.284],[1,54.378],[2,54.908],[3,55.166],[4,56.022],[5,56.158],[6,56.389],[7,56.525]]},{"speaker":"weiss","en":"You're very kind. I've never met my neighbors before.","vi":"Các cháu tốt quá. Bà chưa từng gặp hàng xóm của mình bao giờ.","ipa":["jʊɹ","ˈvɛɹi","kaɪnd","aɪv","ˈnɛvɚ","mɛt","maɪ","ˈneɪbɚz","bɪˈfɔɹ"],"start":